---
name: Subscribe to the MISP ZeroMQ stream
description: |
  Receives IOC changes from MISP in real time. Enable the ZeroMQ plugin in MISP
  under Administration > Server Settings > Plugin settings.
---

// Docs:
//   https://www.circl.lu/doc/misp/misp-zmq/
//   https://tenzir.com/docs/reference/operators/from_zmq
//   https://tenzir.com/integrations/zeromq
//
// MISP publishes `misp_json_attribute <json>` for every attribute change. We
// subscribe to that topic prefix and let `read_json` parse what follows.
from_zmq "tcp://misp.example.org:50000", prefix="misp_json_attribute " {
  read_json
}
where Attribute.to_ids == "1" and not Attribute.deleted?
ioc = ip(Attribute.value) if Attribute.type in ["ip-src", "ip-dst"] else Attribute.value
context_update "misp_iocs", key=ioc, value={
  type: Attribute.type,
  category: Attribute.category,
  comment: Attribute.comment,
  event_id: Attribute.event_id,
}
